###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Energy and force RMSE learning curves for each selection strategy (Figs. 7-10) are figure-only.
# - Similarity validation on QM7b and SHIFTML-molfrags (Sec. 2.2) concerns data-set visualisation, not MLIPs; processing times (Table 1) are for similarity computation.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/iwasaki2026.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.
